      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "What are the confirmed materials?",
          "answer": "The upper is cow leather with no separate lining. The sole is described as cork; individual midsole and ground-contact outsole layer formulations are not specified. Send detailed material requirements for confirmation before ordering."
        },
        {
          "question": "Which colours and sizes can I request?",
          "answer": "Beige and Camel, with size labels 35-45. Send your colour-size quantities. Current availability and fit measurements are confirmed before order; no unverified US size conversion is provided."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is the minimum order and price?",
          "answer": "The listed minimum order is 2 pairs. Reference unit prices are USD 17.47 for 2-49 pairs, USD 16.31 for 50-99 pairs and USD 15.14 for 100 pairs or more. Freight, packaging and final order terms are confirmed separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "How do I confirm fit for my assortment?",
          "answer": "Please share the sizes you need and your fit or measurement requirements. Confirm the agreed size labels and product measurements before ordering. No foot-length chart or wider-fit promise has been verified for this style."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can I request samples or customization?",
          "answer": "Send your sample quantity, logo, colour and packaging requirements. Feasibility, sample charges, minimum quantities and timing are assessed before quotation; customization is not included automatically."
        },
        {
          "question": "How are dispatch and delivery arranged?",
          "answer": "Send your destination, quantities and required date. Colour-size availability, packaging, freight options and dispatch timing are confirmed before order. The listing does not guarantee current stock or a fixed seven-day dispatch period."
        }
